Observed: openRoom, publish, loadRules, active issue choices and open-issue accepted assertions completed. After no-argument `d.pause()`, `listLanes(room)` returned normally, and `.issues.find(title === "Clear task")` was undefined. The following `.scope` access threw after 4,824 ms. This establishes absence of that matching projected issue row; it does not establish a forbidden Page read or an owner mismatch.

